//    the first time, or by your main application that knows what modules
//    introduces what types), like this:
//    ```c
//    new_type_id = g_type_register_dynamic (parent_type_id,
//                                           "TypeName",
//                                           new_type_plugin,
//                                           type_flags);
//    ```
